WEBVTT

00:26:58.880 --> 00:27:01.284
and getting ahead in the organization.

00:27:01.308 --> 00:27:05.076
And things -- the organization
is headed in the wrong direction,

00:27:05.100 --> 00:27:07.936
and you just are not
going to say anything."

00:27:07.960 --> 00:27:09.686
It was my authentic belief.

00:27:09.710 --> 00:27:11.646
AG: Carmen refused to conform.

00:27:11.670 --> 00:27:13.316
She couldn't let go of this idea

00:27:13.340 --> 00:27:15.806
that the internet would change the CIA,

00:27:15.830 --> 00:27:19.386
and she didn't adjust the way
she expressed her idea, either.

00:27:19.410 --> 00:27:22.066
Eventually, the CIA sidelined her.

00:27:22.090 --> 00:27:24.896
CM: Nobody would hire me.

00:27:24.920 --> 00:27:27.358
I got the really helpful feedback

00:27:27.382 --> 00:27:31.246
from someone who did not
choose me for a position.